---
import Contact from "../components/Contact.astro";
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Working with nonprofits | John Blackwell"
  description="Accessible, mobile-friendly websites and small tools for nonprofits, pro bono or paid."
>
  <h1>Working with nonprofits</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    Small nonprofits often run on websites and forms that are hard to use on a phone, with a screen reader,
    or in a language other than English. I help fix that.
  </p>

  <h2>What I can help with</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Finding and fixing accessibility problems, measured against WCAG 2.2 AA</li>
    <li>Making pages and forms work on small screens</li>
    <li>Application and sign-up forms that work in more than one language</li>
    <li>Small tools that replace a spreadsheet or a paper process</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>Pro bono</strong> for small, volunteer-run programs without a technology budget.
    <strong>Paid</strong> work for organizations that have a budget for it. Either way, we start with a short
    call and a free review of your site, and you get a written list of what I found.
  </p>

  <h2>Get in touch</h2>
  <Contact />
</Base>

<style>
  .lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }
</style>
